The native projection and lifting spans are 0.446 and 23.186 seconds; they are
not an exclusive partition of the total. Serialization, decoding and independent
verification account for much of the process time. Both children used one Rayon
thread, under a 100 GB allowance. These are native geometry-driver observations,
not a timed release-CLI generation of the regulated integral. The earlier
parametric investigation did not complete; a general parametric double-box
family is not established by the successful exact-point solve.

The remaining geometry is substantial. Later algebraic roots move with earlier
coordinates, and 604,005 cells have an infinite boundary. Catalogue complexity
in each lifting variable is:

